From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chelovechishee <261262090+chelovechishee@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 18/53] ASoC: samsung: add ABOX from the downstream kernel
 (WIP); arm64: dts: gta3xlwifi: ABOX, SysMMU, ABOX GIC

Port to the 7.3 ASoC API (components instead of codec/platform drivers),
an unmanaged IOMMU domain for the DSP address space, built-in DSP firmware
loaded synchronously in probe. Compress offload, PCM dump, effects, VSS and
BT SCO are left out. Bring-up: probe is gated by snd_soc_abox.enable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
